@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #466482
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title 系统功能与参与者导航

left to right direction
actor "中心内部成员" as internal
actor "部门管理人员" as manager
actor "指导老师" as teacher
actor "外部组织" as external
rectangle "统一工作台（分区详图见四张系统用例图）" {
rectangle "推文审校与发布" as p
rectangle "部门协作与交付" as j
rectangle "工时统计与结算" as a
rectangle "公共访问与配置" as s
}
internal -- p
internal -- j
internal -- a
manager -- s
teacher -- p
teacher -- j
external -- p
external -- j
note bottom of s
此图是功能分区导航，不新增用例编号。
系统与数据库均在软件边界内，不是参与者。
end note

@enduml
